---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Start Here — The Little AI Company"
  description="New to AI? Make your first useful thing in about 15 minutes, then keep the cheat-sheets that make it stick."
>
  <section class="sh">
    <div class="sh-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">// start here</span>
      <h1>Make your first useful thing.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        You don't learn AI by reading about it — you learn it by making one useful thing,
        start to finish. Bring a real task. In about 15 minutes you'll have something you
        can use, plus the judgment to know when to trust it.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/guides/first-useful-thing">Open the worksheet →</a>

      <ol class="path">
        <li><b>Pick a task.</b> Not sure? <a href="/guides/use-case-menu">Steal one from the menu.</a></li>
        <li><b>Write the brief.</b> Five parts, fill in the blanks — <a href="/guides/prompt-anatomy">the Prompt Anatomy.</a></li>
        <li><b>Check it.</b> Make sure it isn't bluffing — <a href="/guides/is-ai-wrong">the Is-AI-Wrong checklist.</a></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="all"><a href="/guides">Or browse the whole Starter Kit →</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-art">
      <img src="/mascot/pose-06.png" alt="" width="220" height="220" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .sh { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr; gap: 30px; align-items: center; padding: 56px 0 40px; }
  .sh h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 5.4vw, 60px); font-weight: 900; margin: 16px 0 0; max-width: 12ch; }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); font-size: 18.5px; margin: 18px 0 26px; max-width: 52ch; }
  .path { margin: 30px 0 0; padding-left: 22px; display: grid; gap: 12px; max-width: 54ch; }
  .path li { padding-left: 6px; }
  .path a { color: var(--signal); }
  .all { margin-top: 22px; font-weight: 600; }
  .all a { color: var(--signal); text-decoration: none; }
  .sh-art { display: grid; place-items: center; }
  .sh-art img { width: 220px; height: auto; filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 18px rgba(33, 29, 23, 0.10)); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .sh { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .sh-art { order: -1; }
    .sh-art img { width: 150px; }
  }
</style>
